Package: virtiofs-notify-guest
Version: 1.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: local <root@localhost>
Depends: dkms, python3, linux-headers-amd64
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Description: replay host-side virtiofs changes as inotify events
 Receives change events from virtiofs-notify-host on the Proxmox host over vsock and
 fires them through the inotify_trigger kernel module (built with DKMS), so programs
 watching virtiofs mounts with inotify see changes made on the host or by other VMs.
